    "Id": "chassisdef_kageoni_KGO-3K",
    "Name": "Kageoni",
    "Details": "The first variant of the Kageoni, the KGO-3K, mounts Railgun as the main damage dealers with two Enhanced LRM-20 launchers as support. One large and two medium extended range lasers are housed in the left torso as secondary firepower when extra output is needed.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Multi Trac</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.38</color></b>",
